" ghpr setup  1/7 Accounts                                                       "
"Which GitHub accounts should ghpr use?                                          "
"Each gets a profile with its own token, settings, and seen/snoozed state.       "
"                                                                                "
"› [x] me-work · gh's active account · profile job                               "
"  [x] me                                                                        "
"  [ ] A token from an environment variable…                                     "
