"┌ Preview ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│me-work                                                                       │"
"│Token from `gh auth token --user me-work`.                                    │"
"│Scopes: gist, read:org, repo.                                                 │"
"│gh's active account: what ghpr uses everywhere today.                         │"
"│In your config as profile job.                                                │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│2 selected → 2 profiles. Next you name them and choose where each applies;    │"
"│everything after that is asked per profile.                                   │"
